WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.833
- Here's a pro tip.

00:00:00.833 --> 00:00:02.830
Don't ask to go on vacation in Jamaica

00:00:02.830 --> 00:00:05.210
if you're on trial for
storming the Capitol

00:00:05.210 --> 00:00:07.720
in one of the funniest minute orders ever.

00:00:07.720 --> 00:00:08.980
Well here, I'll just read it to you.

00:00:08.980 --> 00:00:10.477
This is straight from the judge.

00:00:10.477 --> 00:00:13.030
"Defendant, while on pretrial
release and facing charges

00:00:13.030 --> 00:00:14.710
including a serious felony offense

00:00:14.710 --> 00:00:17.560
stemming from his alleged
actions on January 6th, 2021,

00:00:17.560 --> 00:00:20.190
wishes to leave the Michigan
winter to spend 10 days

00:00:20.190 --> 00:00:21.870
in the warmer climes of Jamaica

00:00:21.870 --> 00:00:23.090
to meet the family of a woman

00:00:23.090 --> 00:00:25.400
with whom defendant has been
in a committed relationship.

00:00:25.400 --> 00:00:27.470
Although such a meeting
may be an important step

00:00:27.470 --> 00:00:28.990
in defendant's personal relationship,

00:00:28.990 --> 00:00:30.690
defendant surrendered his entitlement

00:00:30.690 --> 00:00:32.890
to unfettered international
travel when also,

00:00:32.890 --> 00:00:36.020
'He allegedly announced his
intent to' storm the swamp.

00:00:36.020 --> 00:00:38.680
And one week later on January 6th, 2021

00:00:38.680 --> 00:00:40.970
followed through by joining
a mob at the Capitol,

00:00:40.970 --> 00:00:43.900
that in his words 'took
that (beep) building,'

00:00:43.900 --> 00:00:45.910
an event he allegedly viewed as the

00:00:45.910 --> 00:00:47.310
'proudest day of his life.'

00:00:47.310 --> 00:00:49.900
This court will not commemorate
the one year anniversary

00:00:49.900 --> 00:00:50.930
of this attack on the Capitol

00:00:50.930 --> 00:00:52.320
by granting defendant's request

00:00:52.320 --> 00:00:53.930
for non-essential foreign travel."

00:00:53.930 --> 00:00:56.640
Signed by Chief Judge Beryl A. Howell.

00:00:56.640 --> 00:00:57.473
Dang!

